    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1raw__os__ostream" kindref="compound">raw_os_ostream</ref> - A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1raw__ostream" kindref="compound">raw_ostream</ref> that writes to an std::ostream. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is a simple adaptor class. It does not check for output errors; clients should use the underlying stream to detect errors. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
